<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Domasna zadaca</title>
</head>
<body>
<p>
<h1>
    Kontrolen panel za pameten dom &copy;
</h1>
Menu:<br>
<a href="#Kujna">Kujna</a><br>
<a href="#Spalna">Spalna</a><br>
<a href="#Dnevna">Dnevna</a><br>
<a href="#Gradina">Gradina</a><br>
<section id="Kujna"></section>
<h2>
    Kujna
</h2>
<h3>
    Detektor za chad
</h3>
<input type="radio" name="chad">Detected
<input type="radio" name="chad" checked>Not detected<br><br>
Battery:<strong> 47%</strong><br>
Status:<strong> ON</strong> 
<h3>
    Senzor za vnatresna temperatura vo frizider
</h3>
<input type="number" name="frizider" value="13" min="4" max="16"><br><br>
Battery:<strong> 43%</strong><br>
Status:<strong> ON</strong>
<h3>    
    Senzor za vnatresna temperatura vo sporet
</h3>
<input type="range" name="sporet" value="150" min="50" max="300"><br><br>
Battery:<strong> 22%</strong><br>
Status:<strong> OFF</strong>
<section id="Spalna"></section>
<h2>
    Spalna
</h2>
<h3>
    Detektor za jaglerod monoksid
</h3>
<input type="radio" name="monoksid" checked>Detected
<input type="radio" name="monoksid">Not detected<br><br>
Battery:<strong> 36%</strong><br>
Status:<strong> ON</strong>
<h3>
    Grealka
</h3>
<input type="color" name="grealka" value="red"><br><br>
Battery:<strong> 90%</strong><br>
Status:<strong> ON</strong>
<h3>
    Jacina na procistuvac na vozduh
</h3>
<input type="range" name="procistuvac" value="2" min="0" max="5"><br><br>
Battery:<strong> 67%</strong><br>
Status:<strong> ON</strong>  
<section id="Dnevna"></section>
<h2>
    Dnevna
</h2>
<h3>
    Pametni roletni
</h3>
<input type="radio" name="roletni">ON
<input type="radio" name="roletni">OFF<br><br>
Battery:<strong> 57%</strong><br>
Status:<strong> ON</strong>
<h3>
    Senzor za prashina na pod (Roomba mode)
</h3>
<select>
    <option>Minimum</option>
    <option>Economic</option>
    <option>Strong</option>
    <option>Maximum</option>
</select>
<br><br>
Battery:<strong> 13%</strong><br>
Status:<strong> OFF</strong>
<h3>
    Klimatski ured
</h3>
<input type="number" name="AC" value="25" min="10" max="30"><br><br>
Battery:<strong> 26%</strong><br>
Status:<strong> ON</strong>
<section id="Gradina"></section>
<h2>
    Gradina
</h2>
<h3>
    Senzor za mocija
</h3>
<input type="radio" name="mocija" checked>Detected
<input type="radio" name="mocija">Not detected<br><br>
Battery:<strong> 54%</strong><br>
Status:<strong> ON</strong>
<h3>
    Podesuvac za vlaznost na zemjata
</h3>
<input type="range" name="vlaznost" value="30" min="0" max="100"><br><br>
Battery:<strong> 70%</strong><br>
Status:<strong> ON</strong>
<h3>
    Solaren panel
</h3>
<input type="color" name="solaren" value="yellow"><br><br>
Battery:<strong> 11%</strong><br>
Status:<strong> OFF</strong><br><br>
<details>
<summary>
<strong>Notifikacii</strong>
</summary>
<ul>
<li><u>Notifikacija</u>za detektiran chad vo kujnata</li>
<li><u>Notifikacija</u> za nepreporacana temperatura na friziderot</li>
<li><u>Notifikacija</u> za niska baterija na roomba</li>
<li><u>Notifikacija</u> za detektirana mocija vo gradinata</li>
<li><u>Notifikacija</u> za previsoka temperatura vo sporetot</li>
<li><u>Notifikacija</u> za niska baterija na solaren panel</li>
</ul>
</details>
</p>    
</body>
</html>